Subject: [PATCH 077/243] NVIDIA: SAUCE: hsierrrptinj: increase SDMMC clients

Increase SDMMC clients from 5 to 9 to support boards with
rootfs over eMMC only.

http://nvbugs/4363881
http://nvbugs/4577729
http://nvbugs/4385191

Change-Id: I6741a4d8bb31b6e40f63db31ee16404fd36e6a94
Signed-off-by: Sathyam Panda <sathyamp@nvidia.com>
(cherry picked from commit 02c53120a7e0ff76db20f43f44512babdfe17c10)
Reviewed-on: https://git-master.nvidia.com/r/c/3rdparty/canonical/linux-noble/+/3193515
Reviewed-by: Laxman Dewangan <ldewangan@nvidia.com>
Tested-by: Petlozu Pravareshwar <petlozup@nvidia.com>
GVS: buildbot_gerritrpt <buildbot_gerritrpt@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-by: Petlozu Pravareshwar <petlozup@nvidia.com>

diff --git a/drivers/platform/tegra/tegra-hsierrrptinj.c b/drivers/platform/tegra/tegra-hsierrrptinj.c
